attempts.raw:
@start **The window opens on a spine.** Columns 0 to 9, `yiiM` to `rhaM`, are carried by 92 to 100% of chromosomes, all persistent, in a region of plasticity in 0 to 9% of calls {S1, P}. The model names 11 to 100% of them, fewest at column 4, `rhaR`, 11% {S1}.

@variable **A fork and variable stretch follows at `frvA`**, columns 10 to 14, carried by 69 to 79%, in a region of plasticity in 70 to 80% of calls {S2}. The `rha` genes, columns 3 to 9, are [[l-rhamnose catabolism]] {S1, Q}. Through columns 26 to 33 a branch of 8 families runs in 16 to 18%, [[sulfoquinovose and sugar transport]] {S6.b26, Q}.

@model **The model names more genes on the spine columns than on the fork and variable ones**, 95 against 91%, and hesitates less there, 0.16 against 0.34 bits {M}. It hesitates most at column 10, `frvA`, a fork column, 0.75 bits {H}.

@end **The window ends on fork columns.** Columns 72 to 79, `udp` to `rhtB`, are carried by 44 to 89% of chromosomes, all persistent {S8}. The last column is `rhtB`, in 44% of chromosomes {E}.

@whole **Across the window it names 94% of genes**, 0.22 bits on average, perplexity 1.3 families {G}. Inside a region of plasticity it hesitates more than outside, 0.50 against 0.13 bits, and names fewer genes, 87% against 96% {C}.

